Byte order in audio code. Sequence data, sound tables, oscillator tables
and FIR coefficients stay big-endian in memory on the host, so reads
assemble the big-endian value (port_be16/port_be32) and oscillator tables
are replaced by a host-order copy (port_osc_table). Stream (.ast) headers
read raw from the disc are swapped in place (port_ast_header/block, in
tools/web_wasm/sdk/dsp_mixer.cpp).

